Step 1 (16:33:26–16:33:31; 38407-cfg-xlate.sh + .out, no `% ` line):
```
interface port3.0.13 / switchport vlan translation vlan 3996 vlan 3995
interface port1.0.2  / switchport vlan translation vlan 3997 vlan 3995
```
Read back, `show interface switchport vlan translation`:
```
Interface: port1.0.2    VLAN on Wire 3997   VLAN 3995   Outer Vlan 0   / default accept
Interface: port1.0.13   default accept
Interface: port3.0.13   VLAN on Wire 3996   VLAN 3995   Outer Vlan 0   / default accept
```
`show running-config interface port3.0.13`: trunk, `allowed vlan add 3995`, `switchport vlan
translation vlan 3996 vlan 3995`. port1.0.2: trunk, allowed 3995, native 3991, `switchport vlan
translation vlan 3997 vlan 3995`. **Step 1 PASS.**

